  "costBpsOfOffer": [0, 5000, 8000, 9000],
  "comparator": "fixed_max",
  "decisionRule": "A policy is a default candidate over fixed_max only if, in every buyer by price-world slice, its focal seats and whole-pool seats are at least fixed_max's and its whole-pool margin is at least fixed_max's at every declared cost. Otherwise no policy is dominant, no overall winner is named, and the choice stays a product decision that needs a merchant cost and buyer mix."
